    "According to you, how can LLMs be used to innovate math learning in schools and universities?": "LLMs can personalize learning by adapting to individual paces, explaining concepts in simple terms, and providing practice problems. They can also generate visual aids like graphs or step-by-step solutions, making abstract topics more relatable. This helps students build confidence without feeling overwhelmed."
